  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><span><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Help.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/70?cb=20171216152011\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>This page is missing some <b>images</b>. You can help the Hay Day Wiki by <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" title=\"Special:Upload\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">uploading</a> missing pictures.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>\n</p><div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> this page is about experience levels, not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation levels</a>.</i></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/Experience_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240126131743\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Experience bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/Experience_Bar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20240126131743\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"163\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Experience bar</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Experience levels</b> are levels obtained in the player's game. See <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> for more details.\n</p><p>After level 126, no new items are given besides <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/field-26294\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Field\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fields</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Table of levels</b></span></h3>\n<p>The following is a table of 'level-up' pictures, rewards given or unlocked, and experience points needed for the first 300 levels that can be achieved in Hay Day.\n</p><p><i>Notes:</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>The new icon (<span>New</span><span title=\"New\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"New\"><img alt=\"New\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/New_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20180821171643\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) denotes items that are not shown in the pictures as they have been added after the shots were taken.</i></li>\n<li><i>The star icon(★) denotes unlocked items or features that Hay Day does not show in level-up images.</i></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-1-25-23947\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 1-25\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 1-25</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-26-50-23949\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 26-50\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 26-50</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-51-75-23950\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 51-75\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 51-75</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-76-100-23951\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 76-100\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 76-100</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-101-125-25223\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 101-125\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 101-125</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-126-150-27513\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 126-150\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 126-150</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-151-175-28169\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 151-175\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 151-175</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-176-200-32507\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 176-200\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 176-200</a>, \n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-201-225-33758\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 201-225\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 201-225</a>,\n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-226-250-35763\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 226-250\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 226-250</a>,\n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-251-275-35789\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 251-275\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 251-275</a>,\n<a href=\"/wiki/experience-levels-levels-276-300-35790\" title=\"Experience Levels/Levels 276-300\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Levels 276-300</a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831163735\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1504/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 307/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639591/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.713      1 -total\n 54.26%   14.495      1 Template:Infoicon\n 24.69%    6.596      1 Template:NeedPic\n  7.38%    1.972      1 Template:Languages\n  4.96%    1.324      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  4.32%    1.153      1 Template:MessageBox\n  3.99%    1.067      1 Template:Note\n  3.43%    0.916      1 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:2057-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831163735 and revision id 107403. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
